{"last_link_id": 7, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["### 📘 应用说明\n- 使用 **ESRGAN** 对视频逐帧进行 4× 放大，强化边缘锐度与纹理。\n- 适合 **动漫/渲染/UI录屏** 等边界清晰、噪点少的素材；对实拍噪声、压缩伪影的鲁棒性较弱。\n- 流程：`Load Video → ESRGAN Upscale (逐帧) → Video Combine（复合输出）`。\n\n**适用场景**：老番、MV片段、游戏录屏、PPT/课程剪辑等纯净类素材的高清化。\n\n**推荐参数**：CRF=18~22；格式 H.264；帧率沿用源视频；ESRGAN_4x 模型；必要时开启平铺（Tile）以降低显存占用。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#5b8740", "size": [740, 260], "pos": [-1546, -840], "id": 11, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["### 🔧 核心参数（可在节点中调整）\n- **UpscaleModelLoader.model**：`ESRGAN_4x.pth`\n- **ImageUpscaleWithModel**：`tile_size=512`，`tile_overlap=32`，`scale_by=4.0`\n- **VHS_VideoCombine**：`format=video/h264-mp4`，`crf=20`，`frame_rate=源视频fps`，`pix_fmt=yuv420p`\n- **显存建议**：≥6GB；开启 Tile 可显著降低显存占用\n- **注意**：ESRGAN锐度强，可能放大压缩伪影；对实拍更建议 RealESRGAN（第2代）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#c9852f", "size": [800, 260], "pos": [-786, -840], "id": 12, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "Filenames", "label": "Filenames", "type": "VHS_FILENAMES", "localized_name": "Filenames"}], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": "ESRGAN4x", "loop_count": 0, "pix_fmt": "yuv420p", "save_metadata": true, "crf": 20, "trim_to_audio": false, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"score": "0", "filename": "ESRGAN4x_00001_p84-audio_bgoyr_1760861697.mp4", "workflow": "ESRGAN4x_00001_p84.png", "fullpath": "/data/ComfyUI/personal/fb63a35c16f151951de4bfcea64b8c6c/output/ESRGAN4x_00001_p84-audio.mp4", "format": "video/h264-mp4", "subfolder": "", "label": "Normal", "type": "output", "frame_rate": 24}}, "format": "video/h264-mp4", "no_preview": false, "frame_rate": 0, "pingpong": false}, "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 5, "label": "i